cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, the models or the imaging resource, please cite the article and the dataset below."
type: software
title: "ecdna-bench: an open imaging resource, benchmark and models for ecDNA quantification in metaphase FISH images"
abstract: >-
  ecdna-bench accompanies an open resource of 2,986 metaphase FISH image sets
  (paired probe-channel RGB and DAPI images with manual gold-standard ecDNA
  annotation; BioImage Archive S-BIAD4097), of which 1,145 with manual
  region-of-interest masks form a benchmark with fixed training, validation and
  test partitions. The repository provides the unified evaluation framework,
  the classical computer-vision pipeline, adapters for published comparators,
  ecCount (a probabilistic-localization model for counting ecDNA), a
  region-of-interest prediction model, frozen result tables and tutorials.
